29\">Tamil Nadu</text>\n<rect x=\"190\" y=\"276\" width=\"2\" height=\"18\" fill=\"#c0392b\"/><text x=\"200\" y=\"286\" font-size=\"10\" fill=\"#212529\">6</text>\n</svg><figcaption class=\"gb-note\" style=\"margin-top:.4rem\">Source: figures as stated in this article.</figcaption></figure>"
